# Normalize line endings so Windows (VS Code / MiKTeX) and Linux (Cowork
# sandbox) sessions stop producing whole-file rewrites that are really just
# CRLF<->LF churn. Added 2026-07-28 after a git status showed 748 files
# "modified" with zero actual content difference (verified via diff after
# stripping \r) - pure line-ending noise, not real edits.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf -text
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
